# Private Kiln Courier story and development planning (never publish).
/FFCardGame/STORY.md
/adventure/STORY.md
/adventure/private/*
# Approved prologue-only reference pack; the ensemble story and recovery archive stay local.
!/adventure/private/kofi1/
